Subject: [PATCH 4/4] docs: errata for approach standoff vs planner inflation
 (w4b/I7 audit)

- semantics-layer-proposal.md: items 4 and the M1 acceptance corrected: the
  standoff must clear obj_radius + inflation, and the routed goal must be the
  free-space projection of the ring point.
- m1-plan.md: M1 acceptance note for the M2 routing wiring.
- m2-design.md: routing decision addendum (project_to_free + required_standoff_m).
